d ping me with any...</span><span class=\"b1-micons\"><span class=\"b1-flag\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 3v14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M5 4h10l-2 3 2 3H5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"b1-msg b1-unread\"><span class=\"b1-avatar b1-av-3\">SR</span><div class=\"b1-mbody\"><div class=\"b1-mrow1\"><span class=\"b1-sender\">Sam Rivera</span><span class=\"b1-time\">10:40 AM</span></div><div class=\"b1-subject\">Design Critique sync</div><div class=\"b1-mrow3\"><span class=\"b1-preview\">Quick reminder that critique is moving to 2pm tomorrow. I'll send a fresh Figma link in the invite shortly.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"b1-msg b1-unread\"><span class=\"b1-avatar b1-av-4\">MS</span><div class=\"b1-mbody\"><div class=\"b1-mrow1\"><span class=\"b1-sender\">Morgan Singh</span><span class=\"b1-time\">9:15 AM</span></div><div class=\"b1-subject\">Architecture review notes</div><div class=\"b1-mrow3\"><span class=\"b1-preview\">Thanks again for joining \u2014 attached are the consolidated notes from this morning's review with action items called...</span><span class=\"b1-micons\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.5 7l-6.4 6.4a2 2 0 0 0 2.8 2.8l6.5-6.5a4 4 0 0 0-5.6-5.6L4.5 10.5a6 6 0 0 0 8.5 8.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></div></div></div><div class=\"b1-date\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 8l5 5 5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Yesterday</span></div><div class=\"b1-msg\"><span class=\"b1-avatar b1-av-2\">CL</span><div class=\"b1-mbody\"><div class=\"b1-mrow1\"><span class=\"b1-sender\">Casey Lee</span><span class=\"b1-time\">Tue 4:18 PM</span></div><div class=\"b1-subject\">Sprint planning recap</div><div class=\"b1-mrow3\"><span class=\"b1-preview\">Posting the recap and capacity numbers from yesterday's planning. Let me know if anything looks off before I lock...</span></div></div></div><div class=\"b1-date\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 8l5 5 5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Last week</span></div><div class=\"b1-msg\"><span class=\"b1-avatar b1-av-5\">RB</span><div class=\"b1-mbody\"><div class=\"b1-mrow1\"><span class=\"b1-sender\">Riley Brooks</span><span class=\"b1-time\">Mon 8:02 AM</span></div><div class=\"b1-subject\">Weekly status update</div><div class=\"b1-mrow3\"><span class=\"b1-preview\">Hi team \u2014 here's the rollup for week 14. We're tracking green on the platform stream and yellow on the data ingest...</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"b1-reader\"><div class=\"b1-reader-tools\"><div class=\"b1-rfrom\"><span class=\"b1-avatar b1-av-1\">JP</span><div class=\"b1-rmeta\"><span class=\"b1-rsender\">Jordan Park</span><span class=\"b1-rrecip\">To: <b>Alex Chen</b>, Sam Rivera, Morgan Singh</span></div></div><div class=\"b1-ractions\"><span class=\"b1-iconbtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 5L4 10l5 5M4.5 10H12a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><span class=\"b1-iconbtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 5L1.5 10 6 15M10 5l-4.5 5L10 15M5.5 10H13a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><span class=\"b1-iconbtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 5l5 5-5 5M15.5 10H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><span class=\"b1-iconbtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 3v14M5 4h10l-2 3 2 3H5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></span><span class=\"b1-iconbtn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span><span class=\"b1-rdate\">Wed 4/16/2026 10:43 AM</span></div></div><div class=\"b1-reader-body\"><h1 class=\"b1-rsubject\">Q4 Roadmap Review</h1><div class=\"b1-actionbar\"><span class=\"b1-pill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 5L4 10l5 5M4.5 10H12a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Reply</span></span><span class=\"b1-pill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 5L1.5 10 6 15M10 5l-4.5 5L10 15M5.5 10H13a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Reply all</span></span><span class=\"b1-pill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 5l5 5-5 5M15.5 10H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Forward</span></span></div><div class=\"b1-prose\"><p>Hi all,</p><p>Sharing the updated Q4 roadmap deck ahead of Friday\u2019s review. The biggest change since last week is the reordering of the platform milestones \u2014 we moved the ingestion refactor up by two weeks so it lands before the reporting work begins, which should unblock the analytics team in early November.</p><p>A few things I\u2019d like us to align on before the meeting:</p><ul><li>The owner for the data quality workstream (currently TBD on slide 7).</li><li>Whether we keep the December freeze date or extend by one sprint to absorb the dependency from the platform team.</li><li>Final scope for the customer-facing dashboard \u2014 we have two options on slide 12.</li></ul><p>I\u2019ll keep the deck open for comments through Thursday afternoon. If you have anything you\u2019d like covered live, drop it in the agenda doc and I\u2019ll fold it into the walkthrough. Otherwise, plan on roughly 20 minutes of presentation and 25 minutes of discussion so we leave time for the budget conversation at the end.</p><p class=\"b1-signoff\">Thanks,<br>Jordan</p></div></div></div></div>"
